window.products.push({"id":319036,"name":"Hamilton Beach Stack & Press Mini 3-Cup Glass Bowl Food Processor & Vegetable Chopper, Black (72860)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iz8jKdDML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Nothing’s better than using garden vegetables to make a fresh summer salsa, but chopping all the tomatoes, onions, and peppers can get tedious. Spend less time in the kitchen and more time in the sun by using the Hamilton Beach stack & press small food Processor & vegetable chopper. It is perfect for chopping vegetables. The stack & press 3 Cup glass bowl chopper creates new opportunities for homemade relishes, dips and spreads. And it is so easy to use; you may be motivated to try something new. There’s no twisting or locking to this chopper-simply place the bowl onto the base and press to chop. Release when you have the desired consistency. The durable Glass bowl resists stains, scratches and odors, so bring on the garlic! In addition, the stainless steel blades deliver reliable chopping action. The streamlined, modern design is functional and attractive. It comes with built in cord storage, so it slides easily into you cupboard. Handy and efficient, The Hamilton Beach stack & press 3 Cup glass bowl chopper is the perfect addition to your kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iz8jKdDML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B00C7186XI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C7186XI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C7186XI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
