window.products.push({"id":319043,"name":"Lockcoo 10 Pack Food Storage Containers Set with Lids Airtight, BPA Free Plastic Food Containers, Leakproof Stackable Kitchen Containers - Freezer, Mi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JRMGxr2tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【10 Pack Food Storage Containers Set】- Your complete bundle comes with 10 premium airtight food storage containers with 10 lids with various sizes, contemporary styling & shape, versatile to meet your everyday food storage needs. Just prepare food ahead of time or store leftovers in our containers, then pop them in the freezer or microwave to enjoy a home-cooked meal anywhere – at home, work, school, or the gym. Fast & easy! Translucent body for easy identification of contents from any angle. 【BPA Free and Safe】- Microwave Safe! Freezer Safe! Dishwasher Safe! Our food storage container set is made of high-quality food-grade PP material, eco-friendly, and BPA free which can keep your food fresh for a long period. They are non-toxic, durable, resilient, and ready to withstand everyday wear and tear, won’t absorb food odors, flavors, or stains. Please note that open the airtight lid before heating and cooking in the microwave. 【New Design Leak-Proof and Keep Food Fresh】- The buckle-free design allows you not to worry about buckle breaking and is easier to open and shut. Silicon Sealing ring built in the cover and No need to worry about the sealing ring falling off. Improved BPA-free locking lid design is easier to open and shut. The silicone lining creates a seal that keeps air out and preserves freshness and prevents food from leaking and spilling. 【6 Size Combinations Fit Your Needs】- Lockcoo food storage containers come in 6 sizes Includes:1*3500ML(118oz),1*2600ML(88oz),1*1600ML(54oz),1*1000mL(34oz),3*800ml(27oz),3*500ml(17oz); From meat, deli food, noodles, green salads, colorful pasta, slime and veggie soups to cupcakes, chocolate desserts, bread, snacks and fruit, these meal prep containers are the way to go. Store food for later or prepare lunch ahead of time! 【Stackable Design and Easy Space Saving】- BPA-free containers for food adopts lid indentations design allowing stackable and nesting, which make efficient use of every inch of your home kitchen. Take up less space and easily fit into & stay organized in the fridge or cabinet which enables you to get the kitchen well-look and frees up space in the pantry. Easy to use and clean. Great for both liquid and solid food. Enjoy your favorite food on the go! Compare with similar items","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JRMGxr2tL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lockcoo","source_asin":"B0BGLFJPDZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319043","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGLFJPDZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGLFJPDZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
