window.products.push({"id":319052,"name":"Potato Ricer,Ricer For Mashed Potatoes,Ricer Kitchen Tool With 3 Interchangeable Discs,Potato Ricer Stainless Steel Creates Smooth Mashed Potato,Spaet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+aCjKHNDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"High-quality stainless steel material:The potato ricer is made of 100% stainless steel heavy materials.Potato ricer stainless steel professional have the ability to resistant stains,corrosion and deformation,it is very durable.Ricer for mashed potatoes are not dented,rusted,bentor broken,so they can be used multiple times. Multi-function and multi-specification potato ricer:The rice presser uses 3 sets of interchangeable thin,medium and thick plates,which can help you quickly make smooth and fluffy mashed potato.Ricer kitchen tool not only used for mashed potatoes,but also very suitable for carrots,pumpkin rice,yam,pumpkin,etc.You can also use it make spaetzle and spaghetti ,strain vegetables,or make delicatebaby food. Non-slip silicone long handle design:The anti-skid and easy-to-grip handle design of the potato squeezer provides a comfortable lever when you are crushing rice and milling,designed to reduce the pressure and tension on your hands and wrists.Just put the food in the ricer for mashed potatoes and press,you can perfectly make smooth and fluffy mashed potatoes. Dishwasher safe,easy to clean and use:The spaetzle press uses removable plates,the whole body of the ricer for mashed potatoes can be disassembled,and it is easy to wash in warm water.Any food residue can be washed away with water.Please ensure that it is properly dried before storing. Large capacity design:The diameter of the potato ricer press is 3.54 inches,the height is 2.76 inches,and the length of the handle is 9.8 inches and 5.2 inches.For those who like to make mashed potatoes,this potato masher will be a tool you should not miss.The large-capacity pressure tank can hold more food,and there are juice holes at the bottom,and the juice isquickly exported.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+aCjKHNDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SPEENSUN","source_asin":"B0C3S31L8Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319052","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3S31L8Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3S31L8Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
