window.products.push({"id":319112,"name":"THERMOS FUNTAINER 16 Ounce Stainless Steel Vacuum Insulated Bottle with Wide Spout Lid, Batman","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K+rWcjY8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The FUNtainer® 16-ounce Vacuum Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Spout keeps drinks cold for up to 12 hours. Our kids water bottles are built so their drinks are as cool on the inside as they look on the outside. Kids stay hydrated and parents stay happy. The double wall stainless steel construction is built to handle drops, dings and assorted roughhousing. Includes an integrated carry handle with soft-touch grip, making it easy for kids to carry with them throughout the day. Help keep germs away with the hygienically covered drinking spout. To clean, you can pop your FUNtainer water bottle in the dishwasher; however washing by hand is recommended. Not for use with hot liquids.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51K+rWcjY8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THERMOS","source_asin":"B0BSFL93PK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319112","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSFL93PK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSFL93PK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":319113,"name":"Petrified Wood Slab, a Polished Fossil Stone Tree Specimen Slice from Madagascar, Each Piece Different for a Unique Gift, Medium-Large 4-5\" Size","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819HaJygg+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These slices were once PART OF A LIVING TREE FROM MADAGASCAR, alive during the Early Triassic period. As the years passed, the once living material was covered by sediment and yet protected from decay. The tree structure was replaced with various minerals as water flowed through the sediment, and eventually, the tree petrified (which means \"turned to stone\"). Different minerals produce the variety of colors that you see in the different pieces we offer. YOU WILL RECEIVE ONE OF SIMILAR QUALITY TO THOSE PICTURED, and while it is possible to receive one of those shown, it is not likely. These pieces are a medium-large size, mostly between 4 to 5\" the longest way. No two pieces are exactly alike; each one is unique. DESPITE IMPERFECTIONS acquired through the ravages of time and force, each one is a nearly complete slice. The wood grain details are visible on the face as well as on the sides. EACH OF THESE PIECES WE OFFER IS UNIQUE, no two pieces are exactly alike, though it is possible for some to come from the same or similar tree. These fossil pieces of Nature are not only prized by rock and mineral collectors, but also those who simply love agates and natural materials. Petrified tree slices and branches make unusual display items and are great conversational pieces in the home or office as well. EAGems is committed to your satisfaction, now and in the future.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/819HaJygg+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EAGems","source_asin":"B01J6VM79U","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319113","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01J6VM79U","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01J6VM79U","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
