window.products.push({"id":319223,"name":"Premium Cotton Canvas Tote Bag with 6 Internal Pockets – Washable Heavy-Duty Cotton Canvas Bag with Reinforced Stitching","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCzLFTbNL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"Sturdy, Reusable Bags Avoid the pitfalls of disposable shopping bags when you arm yourself with reusable bags by JOORY. Available in your choice of gray, dark blue, watermelon or off-white with black details, our cotton canvas-tote-bags are spacious and strong. Load them down with groceries or use them as book totes to get the kids to and from school. Their heavy-duty construction and convenient interior pockets help you organize and transport contents from home to office or school without ripping or splitting or adding petroleum-based bags to landfills. Canvas Totes for Every Task JOORY Reusable Bags can be used as work totes for women or as small diaper bags for short trips around town with baby. With long handles for shoulder carry, they free your hands for your phone and travel mug. Soak-up some sun at the beach with sunscreen, water wings, goggles and other supplies at your fingertips and sorted for easy location and retrieval. All-natural and recyclable, they are must-have sustainable products for your on-the-go family. Shop with a Conscience More than 12 million barrels of oil are used each year to create weak, single-use grocery bags. Those same bags will exist in landfills for up to 1,000 years. JOORY Reusable Canvas Tote Bags are kinder to the environment and survive more trips between the store and home. Our versatile bags are machine-washable so they maintain their like-new appearance, and they fold flat for storage when not in use. With their unlimited potential, JOORY Reusable Bags are indispensable home essentials. Carry groceries and other heavy items without putting a strain on the planet. Add JOORY Reusable Bags with handles to your eco-friendly products today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCzLFTbNL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JOORY","source_asin":"B09LVYJ6BF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319223","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LVYJ6BF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LVYJ6BF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":319224,"name":"Silk Pillowcase for Hair and Skin,Mulberry Silk Pillow Cases Queen Size,Soft,Anti Acne,Cooling,Beauty Sleep,Both Sides Natural Silk Satin Pillowcases ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a0gHjdmkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕【Fights Dryness and Acne】Silk pillowcases are made of high-quality silk fabric,rich in 18 amino acids,which are believed to effectively stimulate the metabolism of skin cells.So your skin will maintain the balanced moisture needed to form a protective layer.The more moisture your skin is hydrated,the less visible fine lines and wrinkles are. 💕【Protect Hair and Face】We spend third of our lives in bed - life can be refined if we turn our sleep into silky spa.Our pure mulberry silk pillowcase which Satin-finished has pearly sheen that provides smooth finish to your face and hair, allowing your hair to glide through, reducing friction by 45% and reducing facial wrinkles.It also protects your curly hair from tangles and gives it natural and healthy glow. 💕【Thermoregulator】Silk also has an inherent cooling ability, giving silk pillow case luxurious touch.Available all year round,natural silk regulates the heat,keeping you cool in hot summer and warm in winter.Natural silk pillowcase perfect for sleeping moments. 💕【Perfect Craftsmanship】Our DBKSLIK silk pillowcases are made with care for you,the sewing needle is 4 stitches / 1cm long,the stitches are neat and fine,strong and durable,hidden zipper closure design makes silk pillowcase perfect to hold your pillow overnight.No need to go around Moving around,the large opening and long zipper make it easier to place your pillow. 💕【Ideal Gift】Choose from a wide variety of colors and sizes,buy our products,and come packaged in a fancy envelope gift box.Silk is symbol of love and nobility and elegance,so silk pillow cases are ideal gift choices for birthdays,anniversaries, Valentine's Day,Mother's Day, Christmas,Thanksgiving,New Year's Day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a0gHjdmkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DKBslik","source_asin":"B0B5WGXZTH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319224","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5WGXZTH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5WGXZTH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
