window.products.push({"id":319298,"name":"Cooko Mandoline Graters,Vegetable Slicers and Cheese Graters,4 Interchangeable Blades with a Peeler,Shredder,Julienne,Chopper,Peeled","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BNHbUWFhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Detachable mandoline slicers. Mandoline slicer has 4 interchangeable stainless steel blades & one extra peeler straight slicer - perfect for slicing fresh cucumber or thinly cut potato chips. Grater - for your cheeses or carrots. Fine grater - ideal for grating garlic, ginger, nutmeg or even chocolate. Julienne slicer - for beautifully consistent vegetable/French fry strips - similar to spiralizer for noodle/spaghetti like vegetables. Peels cutter: Peeling the skin of fruit & vegetable like Apple, pear or carrots, potatoes. The set also comes with a handle guard for safety, you can slice until the very last piece without worrying about cutting your hands. Note: 1. Be careful of the sharp blades. Keep this tool away from your children & avoid injured. 2. When the vegetable is small or becomes smaller (lower than 2.5 inches), please use the safety hand-guard. 3. The container dimension is 26.4 x 11.4 x 9 cm, it can storage a small amount of food, mainly preventing for blades. If you need to service more ingredients, you should get another additional container. 4. The lid of storage container is with a glue label. If you do not like this design, you can soak the lid in warm water for 10-15 minutes, then you can easily tear the label off. When we finish all grater, we should clean our blades with water and place them in the container, it will be used well longer. We can use the peeling knife remove the peel of fruit or vegetable easily. Straight knife can slice for cut potatoes, onions, peppers, tomatoes. Flower holes knife can cut ginger, garlic and so on. Microporous knife can cut thick wire, used in cutting potatoes, cucumber. Holes knife can cut filaments for cutting eggplant, potatoes & carrots. The plastic holder is flexibility strongly and durability. Also the vegetables slicer are holded in ir to keep clean & sanitation. Your cooking time will be highly reduced, just takes a few seconds for preparing any food with this peeler slicer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BNHbUWFhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cooko","source_asin":"B01M1DIDFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319298","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M1DIDFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M1DIDFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
