window.products.push({"id":319417,"name":"Lift & Serve Professional Meatloaf Pan","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mEr778WpL._AC_.jpg","description":"Description;  This is an amazing pan to make perfect, evenly cooked meat loafs. The Lifter that is included, drains fat and regulates heat, make your meat loaf come out perfectly moist, healthy and delicious. The non-stick coating ensures easy release with effortless cleanup every time, and the lifting tray makes it easy to remove the meatloaf from the pan. This product is oven safe to 450°F / 232°C; not intended to be used under a boiler!  With this product we ensure you and easy and quick way to bake, lift and serve meatloaf without the mess ! Dimensions: 12.25IN x 5.75IN This product includes: One pan  One lifter","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41mEr778WpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ERNITERTY","source_asin":"B07NKW16Q6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319417","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NKW16Q6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NKW16Q6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":319418,"name":"yescool Cooling Weighted Blankets Queen Size (15 lbs, 60”x80”), Soft Heavy Blankets for Adults and Teens Sleeping Cool Breathable Blanket for All Seas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3110sFVP34L._AC_.jpg","description":"❄【DEEP SLEEP RELAXATION】Why does a weighted blanket help? Being wrapped in a weighted cooling blanket is like being hugged.Also a scientific evidence lies behind there:Weighted blankets use deep pressure stimulation to stimulate your mood-boosting,ease your mind and calm your body, help you get truly relax and fall asleep. Plus the weight of blanket reduce the times you wake-up so you could get deep sleep from a calming weighted blanket. ❄【COOLING TECHNOLOGY】#`1:Cooling breathable fabric of our heavy blanket regulate temperature by managing heat and moisture. #2: Natural glass beads inside have a SPECIFIC FEATURE to keep you cool by providing you tranquility. #3: Using the AC with the weighted blanket cooling helps to keep you cool all night long on hot summer nights. #4: Superior breathable fabric makes our adult weighted blankets ideal for bedding all year round：summer weighted blanket or a heavy blanket for winter, your call. ❄【HIGH STANDARDS】#1: The non-toxic glass beads are evenly filled in smaller squares (Us：4.7”x4.7” Others：6”x6”). #2:We use extra 2 cotton padding to lock the beads. #3：Weighted blankets for adults apply high-dense stitches(Us：12 stitches/inch Others：8 stitches/inch). All the high industry standards ensure you get a durable one with more even weight distribution but without glass beads leakage. And the even weight distribution apply the same amount of pressure on you to help you sleep better. ❄【CUSTOMERS BE AWARE BEFORE PURCHASE】Our washable weighted blanket are various in color,size and weight.Choose a weight blanket that weighs about 7%~10% of your body weight. For first-time users, we suggest you choose a light weight. IF THE WEIGHT FALLS BETWEEN 2 OPTIONS, THE LIGHTER CHOICE IS RECOMMENDED. And give yourself 1 WEEK to get used to it. For a better weight effect, a queen weighted blanket 60”x80” just cover your mattress WITHOUT OVERHANGING. ❄【OFFICIAL WAY FOR CLEANING】Our soft weighted blankets are machine washable, Bleach-free, gentle detergent cold or warm water on a gentle cycle and avoid fabric softeners. The choice of washing machine is based on the weight of the blanket, no matter what washing machine it is, make sure your washing machine can support the weight of the blanket. Hanging to dry or tumble dry is the official way for drying.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/3110sFVP34L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"yescool","source_asin":"B092MTDTGQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319418","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092MTDTGQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092MTDTGQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
