window.products.push({"id":319456,"name":"COFICE Vow Books for Wedding, His and Hers Marriage Vows to Remember Renewal Brides Journal, Leather Hardcover Booklet Keepsake, Bridal Shower Gift, S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QUMtbZnfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MAKE YOUR WEDDING EVEN MORE SPECIAL: Create your perfect wedding with these vow books. The luxurious leather cover of his and hers books will make you feel like royalty on your special day! The beautiful vow book is perfect for any newlyweds looking to symbolize their everlasting love. The vows book makes the wedding even more special. Vow books for wedding serve as an expression of your love for each other and provide you with sweet memories to last a lifetime! ELEGANT DESIGN: Wedding vow books have an old-world feel with their simple yet elegant design with gold leaf accents on the cover. The gold embossed lettering gives vow books his and hers a charming look that is perfect for a wedding. Our his and her vows book have a special feel. The gold edges make his and her books more elegant and appealing to the eye than other books that have no shine at all! The wedding book has beautiful bookmark ribbons with matching colors. HIGH QUALITY MATERIALS: Our leather-bound his and hers vow books are made with the finest materials. Vow renewal books come in high-quality leather covers, durable enough to protect your most important commitments. Wedding vows books are a great way to add some style while protecting your most important memories from being lost or damaged over time! The vows journal has a beautifully crafted leather hardcover, 48 writing pages with rich foil edging. PERFECT SIZE: These 3 7/8\" x 5 3/4\" wedding books are the perfect size to hold your most important commitments. Our his her vows book is made with high-quality 140GSM thick paper, 24 sheets (48 pages) per book. You will receive two lightweight renew vows notebooks, white and navy blue. The size makes it easy enough that you can hold a brides journal in your hands while also being small enough to be kept in your pocket for photoshoots! CHERISH YOUR MEMORY FOREVER: Our beautiful, gold-stamped his and her marriage books are the perfect way to preserve your vows. This vow renewal gift is a great reminder of important promises that you make. Wedding vows book can be used for anniversaries or milestone dates! The vow journal is perfect to remind you and your loved ones, that they're always most important in your life. A vow to remember books help you remember not only the vows you said but also how they made you feel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QUMtbZnfL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"COFICE","source_asin":"B09JFFFT2M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319456","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09JFFFT2M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09JFFFT2M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
