window.products.push({"id":319498,"name":"BYB 16.4ft/5m UL Listed LED Strip Light Kit, The Best and Safest Light Strip, Waterproof IP65, Daylight White, 300 Units 2835 LEDs, Brighter Than 3528","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41g4nF-LWNL._AC_.jpg","description":"There are an abundance of led strip lights available in the market, but not all led strips are created equal. We focus on quality and safety lighting, which is why our led strip Lights are UL listed. What separates BYB strip lights from the competition? Excellent deal at superior quality BYB led strip lights passed the USA certification UL, the quality of our lights is above and beyond any other led strip lighting out there. We are confident that you will find that these are the highest quality products at the most competitive prices on the market, backed by our top-notch customer service. Pure light and long run-time 2835 LED chip The ordinary LED strip creates a secondary color that is very unpleasant while BYB light maintains its beautiful even color in 180 degree angle throughout the panel. Lifespan is over 50000 hrs. Save effort and maintenance costs on changing lights frequently. Genuine sticky 3M adhesive Most seller use fake 3M adhesive with strip lights on the market that’s why the adhesive backing is useless for attaching them to things. BYB uses genuine 3M adhesive on the strip lights can be easily stick onto most flat surfaces. Safe and reliable FPC board Using a double layer of copper on a FPC board, ensure circuit stable performance. The thicker copper layer helps heat dissipation and prolongs the LED lifespan. Worked with 12V low voltage makes sure it is touchable and safe to children. Waterproof grade up to IP65 Waterproof IP65 ideal for indoor &outdoor use, certifying that the lights are protected against humidity and the occasional water splashing. Please note that light can't be soaked in the water. Because of this lights quality, brightness, and features we are sure you will love it. Just try it out.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41g4nF-LWNL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BYBLIGHT","source_asin":"B01HNWRLPO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319498","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HNWRLPO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HNWRLPO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
