window.products.push({"id":319655,"name":"Sonyabecca Stove Fan with Magnetic Thermometer 4 Blade Stove Fans Heat Powered Fireplace Fan Aluminium Eco-Friendly for Wood Log Burner Fireplace","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYcsLFejL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why do I need a stove fan? The stove fan work without any batteries, so operate for free. It equalizes the warmth produced from your wood burning stove around the room, that’s why a stove fan is a great idea. Stove fans range in price and quality of functionality. If you want to push the hot air from your stoves around the space more effectively then a stove fan is a really good idea. Many homes here have classical install iron fireplaces that have a limited space on the top. However,many stove fans in the market are not suitable for these homes.Now Sonyabecca 4 blade stove fan whose height is 188mm to meet your requirement. How to use? Position the stove fan on a smooth flat surface of your stove top, near the side or back of the stovepipe. The hotter the stove surface is, the more air the fan circulates. Highlights: 1)Circulates warm air throughout the room 2) Powered by heat, speed automatic controlled by temperature of stove top 3) No batteries needed, no running cost, eco-friendly 4) 4 blade,fast spinning speed 5)Start to work at temperature 50°C(122°F) 6) Safe, built-in protection system to stop them overheat 7) Silent operation, no noise, just warmth Parameters: - Material: Anodized aluminum  - Fan Height: 18.8cm/7.4inch  - Air flow: 370CFM(Max)  - Running speed: 1350RPM(Max） - Silent operation, the noise less than 25dB  - Magnetic stove thermometer: Diameter: 6.3cm/2.5inch, monitor temp from 100-900°F(37.7-500°C) Tips : Never handle the base of the stove fan, do not set the stove fan down on an unprotected surface when hot. To move or carry the fan, always always use the extendable handle while wearing gloves. Please keep fan away from small children when in use. Package: 1 X Sonyabecca Stove Fan 1 X Magnetic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71dYcsLFejL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sonyabecca","source_asin":"B07X2HL7BC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319655","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X2HL7BC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X2HL7BC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
