window.products.push({"id":319767,"name":"[2+2 Pack]Galaxy S22 Screen Protector,9H Hardness Tempered Glass Screen Protector,With 2 Pack of Camera Lens Protector,Support fingerprint unlock,No B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a8RAxYvmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Compatibility: Unique designed for Samsung Galaxy S22 5G Tempered Glass screen protector Touch Screen Sensitivity & Fingerprint Recognition: 1.Before installation, please turn on the touch sensitivity switch. Otherwise the problem of insensitive touch will occur after the screen protector installed. Steps: Setting-Display-Touch the sensitivity switch (pull down the bottom and adjust it to the highest). 2.In order not to affect the fingerprint recognition function of the mobile phone, please add a new fingerprint first. When entering a new fingerprint (Please enter your fingerprint in the fingerprint module of the protective film), install the screen protection film firmly on the surface of the phone, and then entry new fingerprint on the screen protection film. Features: HD Clear Fingerprint sensor compatible and maintains the original comfortable touch experience. 9H Hardness Up to 9H hardness, anti-scratch, abrasion resistance, ease impact force. High pressure resistance, it is Five times more effective than ordinary glass screen protector. High Touch Sensitive 0.15 thickness is reliable and resilient, glass screen protector ensures quick response and 100% accurate touch on the screen. Easy to install ✓Clean the screen thoroughly using the included wet & dry wipes. ✓Peel off the thin, clear, protective layer(s) from the screen protector. ✓Finally, put the screen protector onto the screen slowly. Align with the mobile phone and apply pressure to the edge of the screen protector to ensure that the screen protector and the phone are firmly attached and level. It is so easy right! Parcel List: 2 * Galaxy S22 Screen Protector 2 * Camera Lens Protector 1 * Installation Kit 1 * Installation Instruction","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61a8RAxYvmL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OuYteu","source_asin":"B09QC1GVBZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319767","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QC1GVBZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QC1GVBZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
