window.products.push({"id":319803,"name":"Rusticity® Wood Chopping/Cutting Board Round | Handmade | (11.1in x 11.1in)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YDX3TK+1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"It is never too early nor too late to renovate your kitchen with a few rustic additions to complement your wooden spatulas and sun-kissed cabinets. With its rich brown hues, intricate hand-carved designs and a wooden tree trunk texture, Rusticity’s rosewood chopping boards have been skilfully handcrafted by rural artisans from remote villages in India. Specially designed to give maximum area coverage for your vegetables, these boards are made of premium food-grade quality hardwood which can take considerable amounts of strikes and pressure from knives, while protecting your table and countertop from any harm. A perfect accessory to possess in your kitchen. Rusticity stands for the quality of being rustic. We are an international brand of traditional products which have been handcrafted for modern use. Our products are created to add a traditional rustic flavour to your lives, while at the same time, being of modern utility and value. All our products are sourced from traditional artisans from Indian villages who have been in the handcrafting profession for a long time. We acquire all items in a fair and responsible manner and provide some highly needed support to these traditional arts and crafts that are facing a daily struggle to survive in the wake of a globalised mechanised world. *Since these are handcrafted, each individual unit may vary slightly from each other.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71YDX3TK+1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rusticity","source_asin":"B01LYJGEMN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319803","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LYJGEMN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LYJGEMN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
