window.products.push({"id":319997,"name":"Segulah Vacuum Sealer Bag Rolls Vacuum Seal Roll Food Saver Bags Rolls For Food Saver, Vacuum Sealer Machine And Sous Vide (4 Rolls (8\" x 17' +11\" x 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610UkZSoA9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description: - 5 times longer fresh in the vacuum bags-completely natural, without preservatives. - Vacuum sealer rolls are easy to use and to seal items of different sizes and lengths. - Dishwasher safe and food safe, tasteless and odorless, protection against freezer burn, reusable. - Ideal for food sving, freeze dried meal, sous vide, gardening, tea leaves, documents and electronics. Package includes: 2 Rolls of 8 Inch x 17 Feet 2 Rolls of 11 Inch x 17 Feet ) Note:Please pay attention to the follwing points 1. If you need to cut the bag in half for use, please cut off the side of the sealing strip after sealing the side which you cut off.  2. When packaging some food with moisture, oil, crumbs and powder, after the food is put into the bag, you must wipe the moisture, oil, debris, impurities and residues near the hot sealing line of the bag mouth with dry paper towel and dry towel, so as to ensure that there is no moisture, oil, debris and impurities between the two layers of plastic during hot sealing Air leakage after empty packing. 3. When packaging some food with small sharp edges, such as hard tea, bone, shrimp and crab, etc., when such products are aspirated, their tiny sharp feet may pierce the bag and cause air leakage. Therefore, it is recommended to use other packaging bags to wrap them in advance, and then put them into vacuum bags for air extraction. 4. Some fruits and vegetables in the fresh state have respiration, and they release gas all the time. Therefore, after being placed in vacuum for several days, the bag will swell. It is caused by the gas released by the fruits and vegetables themselves, not by air leakage. This kind of vegetables and fruits after high or low temperature treatment, will greatly reduce breathing. For example, banana, chestnut, lily, cauliflower, cucumber, lotus seed and other plants all have respiration.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610UkZSoA9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stickit Graphix","source_asin":"B08FWQCC3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-319997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FWQCC3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FWQCC3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
